# The linker flags a freshly scaffolded macOS project starts with, one per line.
# Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored. They are used until the
# first macOS build replaces them with the answer of `rustc --print native-static-libs`.
#
# The macOS project also spells out the frameworks the windowing and rendering
# layers need, so this only has to cover bindings that arrive through optional
# umbrella features (passkeys, for one).
-framework AppKit
-framework AuthenticationServices
-framework Foundation
-framework Security
-lobjc
